Subject: Select bounded original animation channel sampling on retained native records

Upstream-base: 443164c91fded218656a8443432e642fdad57838

Exclude Wii in-place pointer reconstruction, original pose dependencies and
callback-pool ownership from this native profile. Keep original root, weight
and equal-count morph sampling equations. Guard normalized sample times and
channel indices. Native constant/endpoint weight sampling decodes its valid
single key instead of reading an absent next byte with zero interpolation
weight. Retain unequal-count morph data but reject its currently unqualified
indexing; no reconstructed loop correction or pose success stub is introduced.

